329	     * they share the same last name and address. The last name is compared
330	     * case-insensitively with runs of whitespace collapsed to a single space (and
331	     * surrounding whitespace trimmed); the address is compared in its canonical
332	     * normalised form (see {@link #normalizeAddress(String)}).
333	     *
